'''Chicken Cat''' was an unreleased [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was inaccesible in the game's data but fully functioning. It was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and deleted in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 155
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Chicken Cat
|name2 = Rooster Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rooster Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Chicken Cat is, unsurprisingly, not that good. It's essentially a worse [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], as it has slightly worse range and health, and noticeably worse damage. Additionally, it can't be used on 4-Crown stages. Its faster attack rate does help, and it isn't as spammable, which helps save money, but you should still choose Paris over it.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Rooster Cat is still worthless, but in a slightly different way. It's for the same reasons as its unevolved form, but slightly less replaceability; this time only by a [[Talents|talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], or [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]]. This is worsened by its poor stats, and while firing level 10 waves is nice, Rooster has very, very low damage, making its niche essentially worthless: the waves won't do anything with damage less than 500. Overall, it is still easily replaced by much better units, and as such is just as worthless as its first form.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger|EvolvedClass = Waver|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

