==Trivia==
*Chicken Cat was part of partner-works with [https://twitter.com/Nobe_tto Nobe_tto (のべぇ〜っと)], creator of [https://store.line.me/stickershop/product/1033821/en "Life of Chicken and Chicks"].
*In [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]], Chicken Cat was replaced with an invisible placeholder [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]. It is the only cat that has been replaced with an invisible placeholder.
*Rooster Cat was tied with [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Jamiera Cat]] for the longest Wave attack of any Cat Unit, at 10.

